// expect: 134 trap: memory is exhausted
// An allocation the host cannot grow memory for is Alloc's exhaustion, and
// the run says so where it stops: two lists of two billion bytes each ask
// more of a wasm32 memory than its four billion. On boot 5addc081 the run
// stopped at a bare unreachable in the allocator, like any other stop.
fn main() = len(make_list(536870909)) + len(make_list(536870909))
